  <body>
    <section id="protocol" title="一、复现目标、容差与横向对比">
      <md><![CDATA[
按复现规范，先约定目标指标与容差：**nuScenes 闭环帧率 ≥ 28 FPS（论文 30 FPS，容差 ±2 FPS）**；未报告字段严禁填 0 或估算。
      ]]></md>

      <compare-table caption="表 1：同硬件环境下的指标与证据分级对比">
        <columns>
          <col>方案</col>
          <col>采样步数</col>
          <col>实测帧率</col>
          <col>多随机种子方差</col>
          <col>图读峰值显存</col>
        </columns>
        <row>
          <cell>DriveFlow (Paper)</cell>
          <cell tag="claim">1 step</cell>
          <cell tag="evidence">30 FPS</cell>
          <cell tag="unreported">未报告</cell>
          <cell tag="approx">≈ 42 GB</cell>
        </row>
        <row>
          <cell>DriveFlow (Ours)</cell>
          <cell tag="evidence">1 step</cell>
          <cell tag="evidence">29.4 FPS</cell>
          <cell tag="inference">±0.6 FPS (3 seeds)</cell>
          <cell tag="na">不可比（batch=1）</cell>
        </row>
      </compare-table>

      <metrics>
        <metric label="3 种子均值帧率" value="29.4" unit="FPS" delta="-0.6 vs paper" trend="flat"/>
        <metric label="复现判定" value="通过容差" trend="up"/>
      </metrics>

      <chart type="line" caption="图 1：不同输入视角数下的帧率均值与标准差（err 误差棒）"><![CDATA[{
  "categories": ["2-cam", "4-cam", "6-cam"],
  "series": [
    { "name": "DriveFlow (Ours)", "data": [48.0, 36.2, 29.4], "err": [0.9, 0.7, 0.6] },
    { "name": "Vista-v2", "data": [15.0, 11.2, 8.0], "err": [0.4, 0.3, 0.2] }
  ],
  "x_label": "相机数量",
  "y_label": "FPS"
}]]></chart>
    </section>

    <section id="impl" title="二、复现步骤与公式到代码映射">
      <steps interactive="true">
        <step title="准备 nuScenes 预处理与环境">
          <md><![CDATA[固定 `CUDA 12.4` 与随机种子 `{0, 1, 2}`，对齐时间窗长度 `T=8`。]]></md>
        </step>
        <step title="验证前向管线与单步输出">
          <figure src="./imgs/world_model_arch.svg" alt="Single-step pipeline verification"/>
        </step>
      </steps>

      <figure-group cols="2" caption="复现管线多配置并排对照">
        <figure src="./imgs/world_model_arch.svg" alt="Run A pipeline"/>
        <figure src="./imgs/world_model_arch.svg" alt="Run B pipeline"/>
      </figure-group>

      <tabs>
        <tab title="单步采样配置">
          <equation id="obj" number="2" caption="离散欧拉更新步"><![CDATA[x_{k+1} = x_k + \Delta t \cdot v_\theta(x_k, t_k)]]></equation>
        </tab>
        <tab title="多步对照说明">
          <md><![CDATA[4 步采样可略微改善长时序抖动，但无法满足实时预算。]]></md>
        </tab>
      </tabs>

      <section title="关键实现差异（section 嵌套第 2 层）">
        <code-block lang="diff" file="models/flow_sampler.py" lines="42-50" diff="true" highlight="2,4" eq="obj" caption="时间步离散化微调补丁"><![CDATA[@@ -42,4 +42,4 @@
-t = torch.linspace(0, 1, steps)
+t = torch.linspace(1e-3, 1.0, steps)
 x = x + dt * model(x, t)
 return x]]></code-block>

        <section title="核查清单与检索审计（section 嵌套第 3 层）">
          <checklist>
            <check status="done" detail="误差在 2 FPS 内">单卡 H100 FPS 指标核验</check>
            <check status="todo" detail="待补测 5 个种子">扩展长尾天气切分</check>
            <check status="blocked" detail="缺私有数据权重">实车闭环回放</check>
            <check status="risk" detail="原文未注明 EMA 衰减">训练后期权重平滑</check>
          </checklist>

          <collapse title="展开查看对照文献检索日志">
